# Cloudflare Pages security headers.
#
# This site hosts the privacy policy and terms a payments business is judged
# on, so the baseline matters: no framing (clickjacking a "delete my data"
# link), no MIME sniffing, and referrers trimmed on the way out.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
